          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            1. What Is the Best Mattress for Side Sleepers?
          </h2>

          <p>
            For most side sleepers, buy the <a href="#helix-midnight-luxe">Helix Midnight Luxe</a>. Helix calls it a medium hybrid built for side sleepers, with a gel memory foam pillow top over zoned coils that are firmer under the lower back. That is exactly the brief: soft at the shoulder, supportive at the waist.
          </p>

          <p>
