          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Average-weight side sleepers</h3>

          <p>
            Between roughly 130 and 230 pounds, a medium feel suits most side sleepers. It is the group the Helix Midnight Luxe is designed around.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Heavier side sleepers</h3>

          <p>
